| supervisor | gate_logs | SELECT supervised gate | ❌ DENIED (no RLS policy!) | ✅ ALLOWED (app layer) |
| supervisor | gate_logs | SELECT other gate | ❌ DENIED | ✅ DENIED (app layer) |
